    "Vectorize original action19 postprocessing for B,H,R without changing row-based rotation6d.",
    "Reconstruct native anisotropic stiffness with its algebraically equivalent orthogonal projector; avoid singular basis for compliance parallel to z.",
    "Keep plant execution in task-owned controller; preserve world poses and observation-time tool-frame stiffness as structured outputs.",
    "Fix native SE3_inv squeeze to squeeze(-1), retaining singleton batch, arm and horizon axes in vectorized deployment.",
    "Native CLIP/force-ViT and causal-force observation encoder class bodies are preserved; imports point to local licensed primitives.",
    "Native checkpoint config compatibility removes only inactive false legacy dense flags; active unavailable flags are rejected and removals are recorded.",
    "Native upstream optimizer grouping is preserved and its omitted force/fusion parameters reported; optional all_trainable mode is explicitly adapted.",
    "Full training continuation adds optimizer, scheduler, EMA optimization_step/decay, CPU/CUDA/Python/NumPy RNG and data cursor state; no native loss/math change.",
